      "object_id": "mathia_interpretation_0314f997bbd8d5555fcae783f624cb24d43682ad2c27493e5619e9e04a83c714",
      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "The useful move is to test a discrete spectral state by deforming the geometry and reading survival as a vanishing obstruction. This reframes arithmetic persistence as a transversality problem, while the new-form/old-form split exposes multiplicity as the unresolved structural bottleneck.",
