      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "The decisive representation is not the raw spectrum but a smoothed trace identity in which arithmetic degeneracy becomes coherent diagonal mass. Aggregating by equal trace exposes multiplicity as signal, while off-diagonal terms record correlations that the available arithmetic input does not control.",
