      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "The same correspondences used for upper-bound amplification can be aligned into a resonance. A fixed point changes many geometric branches from incoherent near-returns into repeated exact returns, and the splitting condition selects indices for which that coherence is abundant.",
