      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "The spectral decomposition distinguishes two realizations of the same eigenvalue equation by their behavior at the cusp. This permits conjectures about eigenfunction size or distribution to be tested on an explicitly expandable continuous family before confronting the discrete cuspidal family.",
